# The operation is handed the caller's bare name rather than the effective tree
# it authorized, so a confined tenant's write lands in the default tenant's tree.
MODULE: EffectsStayInTenantActsOnRequestedName
TARGET: EffectsStayInTenant
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the operation acts on the unresolved name
PERTURBS: Act

--- FIND
           t == req.eff
--- REPLACE
           t == req.n
--- END
